{"product_id":"woman-who-died-a-lot","title":"Woman Who Died A Lot","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe BookWorld's leading enforcement officer Thursday Next is at a low point in her life: she is four months into an enforced semi-retirement following a near-fatal assassination attempt. She is yet to walk without a stick, has double vision more often than she doesn't, and limited mobility in her left arm.A time, then, or relaxation, recuperation, and rest. A time to spend with her beloved family, avoid stress, take it easy, meet old friends and do very little.If only life were that simple...\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 131 x 200\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Jasper Fforde\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780340963135\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 380\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45809855856793,"sku":"17RB-5-9780340963135","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68f79e1b9ef97_Woman_Who_Died_A_Lot_Jasper_Fforde.jpg?v=1761070109","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/woman-who-died-a-lot","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}